NAME
    plack-nkc-cnb-validator - Tool for ČNB validator plack app.

SYNOPSIS
     plack-nkc-cnb-validator [-c changes_file] [-d] [-h] [--version]

DESCRIPTION
    Tool to run of ČNB validator Plack web application.

ARGUMENTS
    *       "-c changes_file"

            Option to set Changes file.

    *       "-d"

            Debug mode.

    *       "-h"

            Print help.

    *       "--version"

            Print version of script.

EXAMPLE
     plack-nkc-cnb-validator -h

     # Output:
     # Usage: /home/skim/perl5/bin/plack-nkc-cnb-validator [-c changes_file] [-d] [-h] [--version]
     #         -c changes_file Changes file to present.
     #         -d              Debug mode.
     #         -h              Print help.
     #         --version       Print version.

